  "steps": [
    "Melt the butter with the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat. Add the onion and leeks with a pinch of salt, then cook for 8 to 10 minutes until soft but not coloured.",
    "Stir in the garlic and thyme and cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Add the potatoes, vegetable stock, and water. Bring to a boil, then lower the heat and simmer for 20 minutes, or until the potatoes are very tender.",
    "Blend the soup until smooth with a stick blender, or leave it slightly rustic if you prefer.",
    "Stir in the double cream and black pepper, then warm gently for 2 to 3 minutes. Taste and adjust the salt before serving hot."
  ],
